# Every tracked file in this repo is text, and every blob is already stored
# with LF. What was drifting was the working tree: core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# files to CRLF on checkout, while any file a tool or editor rewrites stays
# LF. The result was a 50/50 mix on disk -- LivingGear_Perks.cpp sat as the
# only CRLF file in a directory of LF files, which quietly breaks exact-text
# tooling (patch application, generated diffs, anything matching across
# files) for no visible reason.
#
# This pins the working tree to LF too, so checkout stops undoing it.
* text=auto eol=lf
